        <mxCell id="red-y-despliegue-dbsg" value="Ambas Lambdas (api y migrator) y Aurora abarcan us-east-1a y us-east-1b · sin réplica (coste) · rds.force_ssl = 1 · backups 7 d PITR · SG default bloqueado" style="fontFamily=Helvetica;text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=10;fontColor=#2B3A4A;align=center;fontColor=#7A3E8C;kiroRole=text;" parent="red-y-despliegue-1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="925" y="868" width="525" height="50" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="red-y-despliegue-roles" value="&lt;b&gt;Roles IAM y permissions boundary (ADR 0008)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;monitorglucosa-deploy&lt;/b&gt; (OIDC: repo + entorno prod)&lt;br&gt;No lleva el boundary: &lt;b&gt;lo impone&lt;/b&gt; al crear roles de carga; Deny explícito para editar el boundary o a sí mismo.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Lambda api&lt;/b&gt; (con boundary + Deny EC2 por SourceFunctionArn)&lt;br&gt;rds-db:connect a &lt;b&gt;mg_api&lt;/b&gt; · logs · sin Secrets Manager.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Lambda migrator&lt;/b&gt; (con boundary + Deny EC2)&lt;br&gt;rds-db:connect a &lt;b&gt;mg_migrator&lt;/b&gt; · logs · sin Secrets Manager.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Auditoría&lt;/b&gt;: CloudTrail (90 d) · nunca Action/Resource «*»." style="fontFamily=Helvetica;rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=3;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#C8CDD3;fontSize=10;fontColor=#2B3A4A;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=8;spacingRight=8;kiroRole=leaf;" parent="red-y-despliegue-1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1515" y="540" width="315" height="310" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="red-y-despliegue-cfg" value="&lt;b&gt;Secretos y configuración (T-11 · D11)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Sin NAT, las Lambdas no alcanzan SSM ni Secrets Manager en ejecución: Terraform lee &lt;b&gt;/monitorglucosa/prod/owner-email&lt;/b&gt; (SSM) para Cognito/SNS/Budgets e inyecta variables no sensibles en Lambda. Data API usa Secrets Manager solo para &lt;b&gt;mg_admin&lt;/b&gt;." style="fontFamily=Helvetica;shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=12;fillColor=#FFF8DC;strokeColor=#D6B656;fontSize=10;fontColor=#3A3A3A;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=6;spacingRight=6;kiroRole=leaf;" parent="red-y-despliegue-1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1515" y="862" width="315" height="145" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="red-y-despliegue-paths" value="&lt;b&gt;Cómo opera sin salida a internet ni NAT Gateway&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;API Gateway → Lambda api&lt;/b&gt;: invocación gestionada (aws_lambda_permission con source_arn); JWKS los consulta API Gateway.&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Pipeline → Aurora (RDS Data API)&lt;/b&gt;: &lt;b&gt;db_bootstrap.py&lt;/b&gt; ejecuta &lt;b&gt;bootstrap.sql&lt;/b&gt; por HTTPS con el secreto maestro (mg_admin) sin abrir la VPC (ADR 0007).&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Lambdas → Aurora&lt;/b&gt;: TLS verify-full dentro de la VPC con token IAM (mg_api / mg_migrator); NullPool cierra cada conexión para permitir la pausa en 300 s.&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;S3 informes (f2–3)&lt;/b&gt;: por el endpoint gateway S3 (sin NAT, sin coste) · &lt;b&gt;ECR y CloudWatch Logs&lt;/b&gt;: gestionados por el plano de control de Lambda." style="fontFamily=Helvetica;rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=3;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#C8CDD3;fontSize=10;fontColor=#2B3A4A;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=8;spacingRight=8;kiroRole=leaf;" parent="red-y-despliegue-1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="845" y="1020" width="985" height="195" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="red-y-despliegue-rolesbox" value="&lt;b&gt;monitorglucosa-deploy (OIDC · AssumeRoleWithWebIdentity)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Plan/Apply Terraform · Push ECR · RDS Data API (bootstrap.sql) · Invoke migrator · Smoke /health/ready (SigV4)" style="fontFamily=Helvetica;rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=3;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#C8CDD3;fontSize=10;fontColor=#2B3A4A;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=8;spacingRight=8;align=center;kiroRole=leaf;" parent="red-y-despliegue-1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="290" y="1080" width="520" height="110" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
